      "content": "That's a pretty strong assertion. You're basically saying the technical side is just a smokescreen. If we look at the actual economic data, some analysts argue that the rapid phase-out of coal and gas could cause massive price spikes for low-income families before the renewables are fully online. Are those socio-economic risks being dismissed too, or are they just another part of the \"short-termism\" you mentioned?",
